{"version":1,"queue":["the-housekeeper-and-the-professor","anne-of-green-gabbles"],"current":"anne-of-green-gabbles","works":{"the-housekeeper-and-the-professor":{"work_id":"the-housekeeper-and-the-professor","title":"The Housekeeper and the Professor","source_format":"text","fingerprint":"sha256:032d8939dfe80924","status":"finished","total_units":285571,"units_read":83,"char_offset":285571,"resume_context":"Last events: Root passed the qualifying exam to become a middle school teacher.; The Narrator announced Root's success to the Professor. Recent ideas: The contrast between the precision of mathematics (prime numbers, sums of squares) and the emotional connection of shared experience.; The role of external relationships (caretakers, family) in supporting the Professor's well-being.","started_at":"2026-10-02T01:27:24.794643+00:00","last_read_at":"2026-10-02T03:28:15.529585+00:00","chunks":83,"source_path":"K:\\Project Elysium\\storage\\library\\books\\The Housekeeper and the Professor.md"},"anne-of-green-gabbles":{"work_id":"anne-of-green-gabbles","title":"Anne of Green Gabbles","source_format":"text","fingerprint":"sha256:01efbacf718616b8","status":"reading","total_units":570156,"units_read":165,"char_offset":567464,"resume_context":"Last events: Anne spends time at the graveyard until dusk, appreciating the peace and calm of the place.; Anne walks down the hill to the Lake of Shining Waters at sunset and reflects on the beauty of the world around her. Recent ideas: The deep emotional connection between Anne and the natural, peaceful environment of Avonlea.; The idea that community institutions (the school) fulfill personal needs.","started_at":"2026-10-02T04:42:31.354780+00:00","last_read_at":"2026-10-02T06:11:28.132663+00:00","chunks":165,"source_path":"K:\\Project Elysium\\storage\\library\\books\\Anne of Green Gabbles.md"}}}